  "示例：=ROUND(3.14159265,4) ，结果：3.1416": "Contoh: =ROUND(3.14159265,4), hasil: 3.1416",
  "将来5分钟": "5 minit seterusnya",
  "FLOOR(数值,基数)": "FLOOR(Num, Cardinal)",
  "示例：=GETPOSITION(打卡地点,'address')，结果：'上海市徐汇区漕河泾新兴技术开发区上海漕河泾开发区智汇园'": "Contoh: =GETPOSITION(Check-in location, 'address'), hasil: 'Shanghai Caohejing Development District Huizhiyuan, Shanghai Caohejing Development District, Xuhui District, Shanghai'",
  "填写护照": "Isi nombor pasport",
  "内容由 AI 生成，可能存在错误，请谨慎使用": "Kandungan AI mungkin ada ralat, guna dengan berhati-hati",
